Gear Lever COSMIC is an independent Rust/libcosmic application inspired by
mijorus/gearlever (https://github.com/mijorus/gearlever), GPL-3.0-or-later.
It is not maintained by the Gear Lever developers and uses none of Gear
Lever's artwork.

The application icon (resources/dev.nilltadios.GearLeverCosmic.svg, its PNG
export and the -symbolic variant) is original SVG artwork created for this
project: a red gear with the blue AppImage package box in its hub. It is
generated by resources/source/make-icon.py.

The application-private fallback theme (resources/icons/GearLeverCosmic)
contains Cosmic Icons by System76, https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-icons,
licensed under CC-BY-SA-4.0. Its source revision and license are included
beside the icons; regenerate it with ci/vendor-icons.py.
